<title>FRANCE: CIC bank 1996 net attrib 847 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>CIC bank 1996 net attrib 847 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     847  vs	     625</p>
<p>    Net banking income			17,131  vs	  16,561</p>
<p>    Operating costs			   13,109  vs	  12,896</p>
<p>    Gross operating			    4,022  vs	   3,665</p>
<p>    Pretax result				1,372  vs	   1,009</p>
<p>    Exceptional result			   174  vs		20</p>
<p>    Company tax				    274  vs	     275</p>
<p>NOTE - CIC said back in October it expected a marked increase in its 1996 net consolidated profit even if the second half was unlikely to match a 60.7 percent rise in first-half 1996 profit, given that the first half was always stronger.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
